@* MindAttic.UiUx — PageScrollbar (Blazor wrapper)

   Canonical source. Blazor subscribers sync a copy into their own Components
   folder (this repo has no build step). Requires page-scrollbar.css +
   page-scrollbar.js loaded once at the app root (see PageScrollbar.md).

   Rendering the track in markup (rather than letting the JS create it) means it
   is present in the SSR'd HTML, so there is no flash before hydration. The JS
   reuses this element if present, or creates one if it is absent. Drop a single
   <PageScrollbar /> in your layout. *@

<div class="ma-scrollbar" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="ma-scrollbar__thumb"></div>
</div>
